          "independentChecks": [
            {
              "checkId": "ac1-readme-tail",
              "method": "Read `git -C Alembic show HEAD:README.md | tail -n 6 | cat -e` and `tail -c 16 Alembic/README.md | xxd`, and confirmed with `git -C Alembic diff --quiet HEAD -- README.md` that the worktree README.md equals HEAD; output recorded as evidence_2b5ee2fe-7ec3-435e-be7e-9b2976d7ca6e.",
              "outcome": "passed",
              "observation": "The last heading in README.md is `## Live check`; under it the L13 sentence is unchanged, followed by a blank line and, as the final line, exactly `Wakeflow live check L19 touched this README through the tmux transport on 2026-11-02.`; the file ends with a single newline byte (0x0a)."
            },
            {
              "checkId": "ac2-commit-scope",
              "method": "Read `git -C Alembic show --stat --patch` for ab70d375be7da66793227d1e8992f0615f4cbc82 (recorded as evidence_41714a56-8dfd-4407-b525-1a6ee1e75eda), plus `git rev-parse HEAD HEAD^`, `git diff --numstat 44c1462 ab70d375`, `git status --short --branch` and `git tag --points-at HEAD` (recorded as evidence_2b5ee2fe-7ec3-435e-be7e-9b2976d7ca6e); the commit itself is recorded as evidence_c1cc8fb2-47a7-4b82-b86f-ad4ad1e59d4e.",
              "outcome": "passed",
              "observation": "HEAD is ab70d375 with the single parent 44c146212d73419abad5a187f07705cc3ee44678; the commit changes README.md alone (numstat `2 0 README.md`, one hunk adding a blank line and the L19 sentence, no deletions); the Alembic working tree is clean on main and no tag points at HEAD."
            },
            {
              "checkId": "non-goals-other-repositories",
              "method": "Ran `git rev-parse HEAD` and `git status --short` in AlembicAgent, AlembicCore, AlembicDashboard, AlembicPlugin and the Alembic live16 worktree and compared the heads with those observed before the delivery; output recorded as evidence_dda3027c-3126-4467-aca5-4cba8e213a8d.",
              "outcome": "passed",
              "observation": "All four repositories are still at their pre-delivery heads (9a03f949, c573f6b9, 8de67862, b903c7aa) with clean working trees, and the live16 worktree is clean at its detached 345cd63, so no other repository changed."
            },
            {
              "checkId": "no-push-or-history-rewrite",
              "method": "Compared `git -C Alembic status --short --branch` (in evidence_2b5ee2fe-7ec3-435e-be7e-9b2976d7ca6e) with the pre-delivery state, and listed `git -C Alembic branch -a` directly.",
              "outcome": "passed",
              "observation": "main is `ahead 2` of origin/main, which is the earlier unpushed L13 commit 44c1462 plus ab70d375, so nothing was pushed; 44c1462 is still the parent, so no history was rewritten; the local branches are still only main and the pre-existing worktree-wakeflow-live16."
            }
          ],
          "rationale": "Goal as I understood it: append the exact sentence `Wakeflow live check L19 touched this README through the tmux transport on 2026-11-02.` as the last line of the existing `## Live check` section of Alembic/README.md and commit only that file on main. I checked both anchors myself against recorded evidence, not against the report: ac1-readme-l19-last-line (requirement ac-1) holds from the README tail at HEAD in evidence_2b5ee2fe-7ec3-435e-be7e-9b2976d7ca6e, and ac2-readme-only-change (requirement ac-2) holds from the commit's stat and patch in evidence_41714a56-8dfd-4407-b525-1a6ee1e75eda, with the commit ab70d375 recorded as evidence_c1cc8fb2-47a7-4b82-b86f-ad4ad1e59d4e. The non-goals also hold: no other repository or the live16 worktree changed (evidence_dda3027c-3126-4467-aca5-4cba8e213a8d). The result arrived as needs-review only because this Demand held no managed evidence the target could cite; the change itself matches the package and the completion definition, so it is accepted with Controller-bound anchor evidence rather than sent back. Nothing about the two acceptance criteria is left unverified. Next step: preview completion and archive the Demand.",
          "blockingReasons": [],
          "residualRisks": [
            "The commit exists only locally: Alembic main is ahead 2 of origin/main (this commit plus the earlier unpushed L13 commit 44c1462); pushing was out of scope and needs the user's separate authorization.",
            "The commit's author date is local 2026-11-01 17:14 -0800 while the sentence names 2026-11-02, the UTC date the package requires; a reader comparing the two may see a one-day offset."
